id=fp_no_lockout
name=FP No Lockout (mfp-daemon patch)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=2erTwo6
description=Neutralize fingerprint failed-attempt lockout at HAL source (mfp-daemon, goodix_us2). Patches: failed_match_count increment -> NOP; per-screenlock quota check forced nonzero. Timed (30s) and permanent lockout can never trigger. Failsafe: verifies stock binary md5 before mounting, auto-skips on OTA mismatch.
